There are benefits to eating giants as you kill them so for a valkyrie I
will typically cycle in and out of the Quest until I no longer get any
benefit from eating giants.  Then I just wade through them the rest of
the way.

The benefits of trolls are a lot smaller by the time of the Quest.  Keep
killing them again and again and eventually each one will no longer
revive.  That's a lot of experience points that no longer matter enough
by the time you're XP 14+ and trolls generate fewer death drops after
they have revived once.

For the knight Quest wading through quasits is the price of having
plenty of tengu.  That's another type of monster that has a benefit from
eating them and after you get the benefit just wade through them to
complete the rest of the Quest.  Then go kill a lot of hostiles to get
your numerical alignment back up to stridently aligned.


